  "title": "Panpsychism",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "ea434dd4-afed-401b-bc72-2ac911883bac",
      "text": "Panpsychism is the view that mentality, in its contemporary form consciousness, is a fundamental and ubiquitous feature of the natural world. It does not require that literally everything has a mind: a rock need not, so long as its fundamental parts do.",
